      "bonuses": [
        "Varzia is also on the Orbiter Market console, which saves the trip to Mars every rotation"
      ],
      "disclosures": [
        {
          "title": "the relics not picked",
          "body": "Blueprint also sits at Uncommon 11% in Lith C6, Lith D1, Lith N9, Lith P7, Meso P3, Meso R2, Neo Z2 and Neo Z3; Vanguard P1 is the only Common one. Chassis is Common in all ten of its relics, so Axi H4, Lith R1, Lith S10, Meso C4, Meso L2, Neo A3, Neo C1, Neo R4 and Vanguard E1 are interchangeable with Axi M1. Neuroptics is Rare 2% in every relic that holds it: Lith M4, Lith M5, Axi M3, Axi M4 and Vanguard M1 are the same odds as Lith M3. Systems is Uncommon 11% in Neo H3 and Vanguard C1 as well, and Rare 2% in Lith M6, Neo M2 and Neo M3, which are the ones to avoid."
        }
      ]
