      "conditions": [
        "Equip the relic before launch and collect 10 Reactant. Falling short does not consume the relic",
        "Neuroptics is the Rare slot in every relic that holds it, so it is the part that stalls the set"
      ],
      "bonuses": [
        "Radiant the Neuroptics relic: 100 traces turns 2% into 10%. Do the same for a rare-slot Systems relic if you are running one",
        "Run Vanguard P1 and the Chassis relics Intact. Refining lowers Common odds, which is the wrong direction for both",
        "A full squad gives four reward rolls to choose from",
        "Spare Commons sell for 15 ducats each, and Intact is the refinement level that maximises them"
      ],
      "disclosures": [
        {
          "title": "refinement table",
          "body": "Intact 0 traces: 25.33% each Common, 11% Uncommon, 2% Rare. Exceptional 25 traces: 23.33 / 13 / 4. Flawless 50 traces: 20 / 17 / 6. Radiant 100 traces: 16.67 / 20 / 10. A crack pays 6-30 traces when you collect 10 Reactant, plus 5 for every squadmate who picks your reward."
        }
      ]
